WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:19.424
Cat licked a paw.

2
00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:22.358
"Let's look for Ann," she said.

3
00:00:22.359 --> 00:00:24.888
"Dirk is Ann's father.

4
00:00:24.889 --> 00:00:28.665
She might know what to do."

5
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:38.523
"Good idea, Cat," Tom said.

6
00:00:38.524 --> 00:00:52.370
He rushed into the castle.

7
00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:59.203
A servant was polishing a suit of armor.

8
00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:03.708
Tom leaned on another suit of armor.

9
00:01:03.709 --> 00:01:07.531
"I'm looking for Ann," he said.

10
00:01:07.532 --> 00:01:10.391
"Watch out!" the servant yelled.

11
00:01:10.392 --> 00:01:13.039
The armor crashed to the floor.

12
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:17.201
"Oops," Tom said. "Sorry!"

13
00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:30.410
The servant did not know where Ann was.

14
00:01:30.411 --> 00:01:32.687
Tom saw another servant.

15
00:01:32.688 --> 00:01:35.744
She was on a ladder and holding candles.

16
00:01:35.745 --> 00:01:39.058
"Excuse me!" Tom called.

17
00:01:39.059 --> 00:01:41.562
He bumped into the ladder.

18
00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:43.448
The servant fell off!

19
00:01:43.449 --> 00:01:48.346
"Oops," said Tom. "Sorry!"

20
00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:55.804
None of the servants knew where Ann was.

21
00:01:55.805 --> 00:01:59.089
Finally Cat had another idea.

22
00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.906
"I know some secret spots in the palace," she said.

23
00:02:02.907 --> 00:02:05.150
"I'll look around inside.

24
00:02:05.151 --> 00:02:21.543
You can try outside."

25
00:02:21.544 --> 00:02:27.378
Cat crept all around the palace.

26
00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:34.576
But Cat did not see Ann anywhere.

27
00:02:34.577 --> 00:02:38.727
Tom looked around outside.

28
00:02:38.728 --> 00:02:44.307
He did not see Ann either.

29
00:02:44.308 --> 00:02:51.813
Finally he went to the Royal Stables.

30
00:02:51.814 --> 00:02:56.640
He woke up the stable boy.

31
00:02:56.641 --> 00:03:00.692
"Do you know where Ann is?" Tom asked.

32
00:03:00.693 --> 00:03:06.544
"No." The stable boy yawned.

33
00:03:06.545 --> 00:03:11.444
"But I heard some news about her father.

34
00:03:11.445 --> 00:03:20.119
Dirk has something big to tell everyone!"
